# Build output.
#
# These patterns are anchored with a leading slash on purpose. An unanchored
# "kilncache" matches any path component with that name, which silently excluded
# the entire cmd/kilncache directory -- the main binary's source -- from the
# repository. It was caught by building from a clean checkout, which is why that
# check exists. See docs/bugs.md, entry 11.
/bin/
/dist/
/kilncache
/chaos
/bench

# Go
*.test
*.out
coverage.out
coverage.html

# Bazel (output base lives in $HOME/.cache/bazel; these are the workspace symlinks)
/fixtures/bazel-cpp/bazel-*
bazel-out
bazel-bin
bazel-testlogs

# Local scratch
/tmp/
*.swp
.DS_Store

# Never commit cache data directories
/data/
/deploy/compose/data/
